{
  "name": "E-commerce 5M – Bot de consultas (Telegram)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bot de Telegram (n8n + ngrok + PostgreSQL)\nTelegram Trigger → Switch → Postgres → Telegram Send Message.\n\n- `/start`: registra al usuario en `telegram_usuarios` y le da la bienvenida.\n- `/pedido 17` (o `/pedido PED-000017`) y `/stock laptop`: consultas de solo lectura.\n- Cualquier otro texto (salida *default*): la ayuda.\n\nGuía: `docs/N8N.md`, sección *Bot de Telegram*. SQL: `n8n/bot-lector.sql` y `n8n/bot-usuarios-telegram.sql`.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "61f43571-85da-475d-a55e-c989ba5e5b68",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "de63a7bd-7c05-49da-a6e8-048335aed51d",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "ea1d3c03-4a05-480e-8389-864c8c4e7b1c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "8fe68cc3-2b35-42aa-944f-4553bad0ef22",
                    "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message.text ?? '').trim() }}",
                    "rightValue": "/start",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "start"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "cdc8ef8b-19ad-4fbf-a806-0b508d2a8c78",
                    "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message.text ?? '').trim() }}",
                    "rightValue": "/pedido",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "pedido"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "79e14075-f3d9-4658-9a14-87bdafa80ca1",
                    "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message.text ?? '').trim() }}",
                    "rightValue": "/stock",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "stock"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "ayuda"
        }
      },
      "id": "196003e6-6ce5-4216-af49-5f97c5d67aba",
      "name": "Switch comando",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id, estado, total, fecha FROM pedidos WHERE id = $1;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ parseInt((($json.message.text ?? '').trim().split(/\\s+/)[1] ?? '').replace(/\\D/g, '')) || 0 ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "f0057d38-d1ea-4056-99b4-1f268757d47f",
      "name": "Consultar pedido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        500,
        -60
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT string_agg(nombre || ': ' || stock || ' pzas, $' || precio, E'\\n') AS lista\nFROM (\n  SELECT nombre, stock, precio FROM productos\n  WHERE publicado = TRUE AND nombre ILIKE '%' || $1 || '%'\n  ORDER BY nombre LIMIT 5\n) t;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ ($json.message.text ?? '').trim().split(/\\s+/).slice(1).join(' ') ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "db369ce9-37e3-4c66-8ad9-1c30c3fcb902",
      "name": "Consultar stock",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        500,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.id ? `📦 Pedido PED-${String($json.id).padStart(6, '0')}\\nEstado: ${$json.estado}\\nTotal: $${Number($json.total).toLocaleString('es-MX', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })}\\nFecha: ${new Date($json.fecha).toLocaleDateString('es-MX')}` : 'No encontré ese pedido. Ejemplo: /pedido 17' }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "10cc26d2-dbac-46c0-b25c-8127902b14e2",
      "name": "Responder pedido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.lista ? `🛒 Productos encontrados:\\n${$json.lista}` : 'No encontré productos con ese nombre. Ejemplo: /stock laptop' }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "d6bd5d1f-ab4f-4f07-b5dc-31f7774a17c6",
      "name": "Responder stock",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "Hola 👋 Soy el bot de Tienda 5M.\n\nComandos:\n/pedido 17 → estado de un pedido\n/stock laptop → existencias de un producto",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "32b06575-a376-4af7-98a8-53bc4c8e9289",
      "name": "Responder ayuda",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO telegram_usuarios (chat_id, username, nombre, apellido, idioma)\nVALUES ($1::bigint, NULLIF($2, ''), NULLIF($3, ''), NULLIF($4, ''), NULLIF($5, ''))\nON CONFLICT (chat_id) DO UPDATE SET\n  username = EXCLUDED.username, nombre = EXCLUDED.nombre,\n  apellido = EXCLUDED.apellido, idioma = EXCLUDED.idioma, ultimo_start = NOW()\nRETURNING chat_id, (xmax = 0) AS nuevo;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ String($json.message.chat.id), $json.message.from.username ?? '', $json.message.from.first_name ?? '', $json.message.from.last_name ?? '', $json.message.from.language_code ?? '' ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "1fa6b4d5-1e0c-412c-bf49-98c4b187b875",
      "name": "Registrar usuario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        500,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ `¡Bienvenido a Tienda 5M, ${$('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.from.first_name ?? ''}! 👋\\n${$json.nuevo ? 'Ya quedaste registrado.' : 'Ya estabas registrado; actualicé tus datos.'}\\n\\nComandos:\\n/pedido 17 → estado de un pedido\\n/stock laptop → existencias de un producto` }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "6d5e0613-4143-44ea-ac6d-616fd8c45000",
      "name": "Mensaje de bienvenida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        -220
      ]
    }
  ],
